             906                     !
             907                                 sumtot=0.
             908                           sumwat=0.
                                   <<< Loop-information Start >>>
                                   <<<  [PARALLELIZATION]
                                   <<<    Standard iteration count: 7
                                   <<<  [OPTIMIZATION]
